<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cinergy Corp cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cinergy Corp cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer &amp; Co said it cut Cinergy Corp to market perform from outperform.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares slipped 1/8 to 35-1/8 in morning trade.</p>
<p>	 (( -- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
